Instant validator: oodac check (8ms) + bin/ooda check cached (44ms warm, 62ms cold) dispatch via check_mod.oo, check_cache.oo, check_drive.oo.

## 0. First Principles
Syntax via token_scan, type via tc_check, capability via check_caps (14 OCap), line-limit via enforcer 256, but check_mod now documents delegation. OCap &FsReadCap/&FsWriteCap/&ProcessCap explicit, zero ambient, fail-closed via process_exit on ERR. Negative trust: all unverified defective until falsified.

