## 2. E-M & 80/20
Ps,info=((T-D)/W)*V: T=tokenize+typecheck ~8ms, D_verify via .ooda-cache/check (g_/t_ stamp+hash) avoids rebuild, D_token via outline sparsely, W~180 lines check_drive, V instant. 80/20: cache key (content_hash + stamp) dominates leverage.

## 3. Hardening Shipped
check_cache.oo: removed sh -c "mkdir -p X && printf 'OK\\n' > p" and sh -c printf '%s' body injection; now sys_exec mkdir -p + write_file only. Setup comment updated to "no shell injection via sh -c".
check_mod.oo: retains tactical separation (Setup in-scope via main.oo), not standalone — correct by design.

